'''''Rumex conglomeratus''''', known as '''clustered dock'''<ref>{{PLANTS|id=RUCO2|taxon=Rumex conglomeratus|access-date=26 October 2015}}</ref> and '''sharp dock''', is a plant of the family [[Polygonaceae]].  It is an annual or biennial plant growing up to 100&nbsp;cm high. A native of Europe, Asia and North Africa, it has also been introduced into North America.

